## Anti Pattern

- [ ] **No Memory**: Starting every session fresh
- [ ] **Memory Overflow**: Storing too much irrelevant data
- [ ] **No Prioritization**: All memories equal importance
- [ ] **No Cleanup**: Memories never expire
- [ ] **No Retrieval**: Storing but not using
- [ ] **Static Memory**: Not updating when context changes

## Best Practice

- [ ] **Prioritize**: Higher importance = higher retrieval priority
- [ ] **Summarize**: Don't store everything, summarize key points
- [ ] **Expire**: Set expiration for temporary information
- [ ] **Tag**: Organize memories with meaningful tags
- [ ] **Retrieve**: Actively use stored memories
- [ ] **Update**: Keep memories current
- [ ] **Context**: Store context with memories
- [ ] **Clean**: Regularly clean up old memories

